  "releaseNotes": "Improved specification generation:\n\t\t\tCHANGED\n\t\t\t* A branch that adds no requirement of its own shows only its heading\n\t\t\t* A test that asserts nothing no longer stops shared clauses from rising\n\t\t\tFIXED\n\t\t\t* The specification no longer depends on the order tests finish in\n\t\t\t* Setups of one member stay with each test where the tests make them in different orders\n\t\t\t* Having steps stay with each test where the tests write them in different orders",
